)","building_count":2469,"extent_type":"Small Settlement Area","grid3_extent_id":"35NLD3663_2","adm1_pcode":"CD52","adm2_pcode":"CD5202","adm3_pcode":"CD520202","health_zone":"Titule","health_area":"Titule 1","name_source":"grid3_names:inside","assessments":[0]}},"assessments":[{"controller_id":"cod-pnc","sovereign_id":"cod","status":"dominant","confidence":"low","basis":"default_state_presence","as_of":"2026-10-01","zone":"Titule health zone (Titule/Kpondolia, Gbulusu, Mabinza, Gare 4, Mokpanga, Liguga)","evidence":"No reports of armed-group control in Titule area in 2025-2026; Bas-Uele security forces described as thin, so state presence is weak but uncontested. Assigned to PNC by default.","unit":"CD5202-buta","run_id":"drc-swarm-1","source_ids":[44]},{"controller_id":"cod-pnc","sovereign_id":"cod","status":"exclusive","confidence":"high","basis":"specific_report","as_of":"2026-10-01","zone":"Buta town (provincial capital of Bas-Uele), all neighbourhoods","evidence":"Buta is the seat of Bas-Uele provincial institutions; PNC performs routine policing and arrests (police raid and arrest at Radio Liberte Buta, Nov 2025). FARDC garrison present but reportedly understrength in early 2026; no armed-group activity reported.","unit":"CD5202-buta","run_id":"drc-swarm-1","presence":[{"entity_id":"cod-anr","role":"present"},{"entity_id":"cod-fardc","role":"present"}],"source_ids":[43,44]},{"controller_id":"cod-pnc","sovereign_id":"cod","status":"dominant","confidence":"medium","basis":"default_state_presence","as_of":"2026-10-01","zone":"Rural Buta secteur villages near Buta (Mabenge, Gwa, Bale, Sukisa)","evidence":"No armed-group presence reported in Buta health zone; state administration from nearby Buta town. Sparse police/administrative presence assumed by default.","unit":"CD5202-buta","run_id":"drc-swarm-1","source_ids":[44]}],"sources":{"44":{"url":"https://actualite.cd/2026/03/08/agression-rwandaise-obed-mutuale-appelle-renforcer-les-fardc-dans-le-bas-uele-et-equiper","title":"Agression rwandaise: Obed Mutuale appelle a renforcer les FARDC dans le Bas-Uele","publisher":"Actualite.cd","date":"2026-03-08"},"43":{"url":"https://rsf.org/en/news/police-close-radio-station-detain-radio-technician-northern-drc","title":"Police close radio station, detain radio technician in northern DRC","publisher":"Reporters Without Borders","date":"2025-12"}},"units":{"CD5202-buta":"Buta territory (Bas-Uele) is far from the active conflict zones of eastern DRC and no armed group is reported to hold territory there as of late 2025-2026. Buta, the provincial capital, is administered and policed by the state: PNC conducts routine policing and arrests (e.g. the November 2025 police raid on Radio Liberte Buta), with a thin FARDC garrison that local actors in early 2026 described as understrength. Rural Buta secteur and the Titule area along the Buta-Titule-Isiro road/rail axis have no reported armed-group control; insecurity there is limited to banditry, poaching and occasional herder-farmer tensions. All locations are assigned to state control (PNC) by default state presence."}}